  "title": "同事闲聊、一起吃午饭",
  "titleEn": "Have you eaten?",
  "goal": "能约同事一起吃饭、聊几句轻松的话题，也能礼貌地拒绝。",
  "chunks": [
    { "id": "u17.c01", "en": "Have you eaten?", "zh": "你吃了吗？", "note": "和中文\"吃了吗\"一样，新加坡同事之间常用来打招呼。" },
    { "id": "u17.c02", "en": "I'm hungry.", "zh": "我饿了。" },
    { "id": "u17.c03", "en": "Do you want to have lunch together?", "zh": "要一起吃午饭吗？" },
    { "id": "u17.c04", "en": "What do you want to eat?", "zh": "你想吃什么？" },
    { "id": "u17.c05", "en": "Let's go to the coffee shop.", "zh": "我们去咖啡店吧。", "note": "新加坡的 coffee shop 就是 kopitiam，有很多小吃摊。" },
    { "id": "u17.c06", "en": "How was your weekend?", "zh": "周末过得怎么样？" },
    { "id": "u17.c07", "en": "That sounds fun!", "zh": "听起来很好玩！", "note": "别人说完一件开心的事，这样回应就很自然。" },
    { "id": "u17.c08", "en": "Sorry, I'm busy today.", "zh": "不好意思，我今天很忙。" },
    { "id": "u17.c09", "en": "Maybe next time.", "zh": "下次吧。", "note": "委婉地拒绝邀请，对方不会不高兴。" }
  ],
  "words": ["eaten", "hungry", "lunch", "together", "eat", "coffee", "shop", "weekend", "fun", "maybe", "next", "time"],
